WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.843
NAND and NOR are universal: either can construct NOT, AND and OR.

00:00:03.843 --> 00:00:07.045
Tie both inputs of a NAND together to make NOT.

00:00:08.045 --> 00:00:11.888
NAND and NOR are universal: either can construct NOT, AND and OR.

00:00:11.888 --> 00:00:15.090
Tie both inputs of a NAND together to make NOT.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:21.034
Modify one input or condition, predict the output, then check your prediction.

00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:23.094
Do not leave inputs floating.

00:00:23.094 --> 00:00:30.510
Actual IC pinouts and active-high/active-low signals depend on the selected device; ask the teacher to check physical connections.
